      "name": "Golden Chains of Servitude (Recharge 5–6)",
      "type": "feat",
      "img": "icons/svg/padlock.svg",
      "system": {
        "category": "technique",
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>Up to three creatures within 24 squares roll vs Resolve (DC 18) or are Restrained by chains of golden light for a minute, taking 2d8 psychic damage (Stress) at the start of each of their turns. A chained creature can spend its action on a Presence check vs DC 18 — denying the Angel's glory out loud — to burst the chains. The Angel finds this genuinely hurtful.</p>",
          "chat": ""
        },
